<Legal title="Cookie Policy | SIRYUS" description="The cookies and similar technologies used on siryushub.com, SIRYUS A.M, SIGNAL. and ARC. Creatives, and how to control them." path="/cookie-policy">
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-page__meta">Effective date: 2 November 2026</p>

  <div class="summary">
    <p><strong>In short:</strong> our sites use only the cookies needed to keep them secure and working, plus one setting that remembers whether you prefer ARC. Creatives in light or dark mode. We do not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking. Because of this, we do not need to ask for your consent before setting them.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files a website stores on your device. Similar technologies, such as your browser's local storage, work in a similar way. Some are essential for a site to work or stay secure. Others remember your choices, measure visits or track you for advertising.</p>
  <p>This policy applies to siryushub.com, artists.siryushub.com (SIRYUS A.M), growth.siryushub.com (SIGNAL.) and collective.siryushub.com (ARC. Creatives), all run by Siryus Creative Media Ltd. Read it together with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>2. What we use</h2>
  <div class="table">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Set by</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Type</th><th>How long</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>__cf_bm</td><td>Cloudflare</td><td>Tells people and bots apart to protect our sites from automated abuse</td><td>Strictly necessary</td><td>30 minutes</td></tr>
        <tr><td>cf_clearance</td><td>Cloudflare</td><td>Remembers that you passed a security check, so you are not asked again</td><td>Strictly necessary</td><td>Up to 1 year, set only after a check</td></tr>
        <tr><td>_cfuvid</td><td>Cloudflare</td><td>Applies fair-use rate limits to visitors who share an internet connection</td><td>Strictly necessary</td><td>End of session</td></tr>
        <tr><td>theme (local storage)</td><td>ARC. Creatives</td><td>Remembers whether you chose light or dark mode</td><td>Preference</td><td>Until you clear it</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>Cloudflare may only set some of these cookies when its security features need them. Cloudflare also gives us anonymous, aggregate visit statistics without setting cookies or identifying you.</p>
  <p>We do not use advertising cookies, social media pixels or analytics tools that track you across other websites. The contact forms on SIRYUS A.M and SIGNAL. and the ARC. Letter sign-up do not set cookies.</p>

  <h2>3. Links to other services</h2>
  <p>Our sites link to services such as Spotify, Apple Music, YouTube, Audiomack, Instagram and TikTok. We do not embed their players, so they cannot set cookies on our pages. When you follow a link, the other service's cookie policy applies.</p>

  <h2>4. How to control cookies</h2>
  <p>Because we only use strictly necessary cookies and one preference setting, the law does not require us to ask for consent. You can still control cookies through your browser settings: you can block or delete them, and clear local storage. If you block Cloudflare's security cookies, parts of our sites may not work, or you may be asked to complete a security check more often.</p>
  <p>Guides for popular browsers: <a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome</a>, <a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Safari</a>, <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/kb/clear-cookies-and-site-data-firefox" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Firefox</a> and <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Edge</a>.</p>

  <h2>5. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If we add tools that use non-essential cookies, such as analytics, advertising or embedded media, we will update this policy first and ask for your consent before setting those cookies.</p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about cookies? Email <a href="mailto:contact@siryushub.com">contact@siryushub.com</a>.</p>
</Legal>
